      "name": "Circling Assault",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The corpsekiller circles around their target then attacks, throwing their foe off balance and puncturing its defenses. The corpsekiller Steps or Strides, then attempts a glaive Strike. On a hit or critical hit, the Strike ignores 10 of their target's resistances. Regardless of the result of the Strike, the target is Off-Guard for 1 round."
